Subject: Action required: approve {{ amount }} {{ currency }} {{ request_type }} request from {{ requested_by }} ({{ department }})
---

Hello,

A purchase request has been submitted and is awaiting your review:

  Request ID:    {{ request_id }}
  Requested by:  {{ requested_by }}
  Department:    {{ department }}
  Amount:        {{ amount }} {{ currency }}
  Spend tier:    {{ spend_tier }}
  SLA deadline:  {{ sla_deadline }}

{% if action_url is defined and action_url %}
Review and decide directly via single-action link:
  Review and decide: {{ action_url }}

(This secure link works once and expires at {{ action_expires_at if (action_expires_at is defined and action_expires_at) else sla_deadline }})
{% else %}
Please sign in to the portal to review this request:
  {{ portal_url if (portal_url is defined and portal_url) else "http://localhost:8080/app/requests" }}
{% endif %}


If you were not expecting this notification or suspect unauthorized activity, please ignore this email and contact IT Security immediately.

— IT Procurement Platform

